cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: LibreNMS MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for LibreNMS (network monitoring): devices, ports, inventory,
  locations and groups, alerts and alert rules, eventlog/syslog, graphs,
  billing, BGP/OSPF/VRF, ARP/FDB lookups, sensors, services and Oxidized
  configs. Read-only mode, tag-based tool filtering and rate limiting.
authors:
